###Listar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen?page=1&limit=3&search=central

###Registrar
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre":"Almacen Principal",
    "codigo":"ALM-001",
    "descripcion":"Almacen de productos terminados",
    "sucursal_id":1
}

###mostrar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1

###modificar
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "nombre":"Almacen Principal Actualizado",
    "codigo":"ALM-002",
    "descripcion":"Almacen de materia prima",
    "sucursal_id":1
}

###eliminar
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/almacen/1
